<title>USA: ASI Solutions Inc IPO cuts price range.</title>
<headline>ASI Solutions Inc IPO cuts price range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price range for the planned initial public offering in ASI Solutions Inc was reduced to $6 to $6.50 per common share from $7 to $8, lead underwriter H.C. Wainwright &amp; Co Inc said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company plans to offer 2.2 million shares under the proposed symbol &quot;ASIS&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market for trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>ASI provides a comprehensive range of human resources.</p>
</text>
